  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the robata grill to medium high heat.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together fish sauce, lime juice, brown sugar, grated ginger, and ground cardamom.",
    "Add the chicken to the bowl and marinate for at least 10 minutes.",
    "Grill the chicken for 5-6 minutes per side, or until cooked through.",
    "Cook the rice noodles according to package instructions.",
    "In a large bowl, combine cooked noodles, grilled chicken, chopped cilantro, and peanuts.",
    "Drizzle sesame oil over the top and toss to combine.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy."
